1
00:00:01,246 --> 00:00:07,312
It is 4:40. School has just moved Mia's pickup to 5:15, and Alex's train is late.

2
00:00:07,614 --> 00:00:10,916
Relay Home rebuilds the evening, and asks before it acts.

3
00:00:12,073 --> 00:00:18,367
This page stands in for Alexa+. Behind it are a real MCP server and an Agent Skill.

4
00:00:19,416 --> 00:00:25,739
One sentence. The agent reads the household, checks helpers and dinners in parallel, and drafts a plan.

5
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:30,032
Every card on screen is an MCP Apps view, served by the server.

6
00:00:31,458 --> 00:00:37,663
Sam would be five minutes late. Lee lives closer, but is not on the school's list. Only Jo may be asked.

7
00:00:40,383 --> 00:00:42,857
Ask for anyone else, and the server refuses.

8
00:00:45,272 --> 00:00:51,476
A tap on a card does not act. It goes back through the agent, and the server answers: input required.

9
00:00:51,777 --> 00:00:53,546
Say no, and nothing happens.

10
00:00:55,225 --> 00:00:58,470
Only a yes, bound to this exact action, lets it through.

11
00:00:59,694 --> 00:01:04,249
Jo has been asked. Relay does not call the pickup covered until Jo answers.

12
00:01:11,643 --> 00:01:17,467
Dinner needs spinach. The shop returns a signed quote, and Relay asks again, for the exact total.

13
00:01:19,546 --> 00:01:25,713
The order is placed once, inside the weekly grocery cap. The evening card updates itself through the host.

14
00:01:28,276 --> 00:01:35,271
The household is remembered between sessions, for this page and for any other MCP client with the same token.

15
00:01:39,346 --> 00:01:44,462
And if Jo could not come? The plan stops, and names no one. It will not reach for the neighbour.

16
00:01:46,742 --> 00:01:54,691
Under the hood: twelve tools over Streamable HTTP, on the newest protocol revision, with a fallback for older clients.

17
00:01:54,993 --> 00:01:58,664
The rules live in the server, so no model can talk its way past them.

18
00:01:58,965 --> 00:02:07,031
In this recording a scripted model follows the skill, so every run is the same. Add a key, and a hosted model takes its place.

19
00:02:07,331 --> 00:02:11,597
Twenty-six tests cover the rules, both protocol revisions, and the agent.

20
00:02:12,751 --> 00:02:20,395
The household and the shop are simulated. The protocol, the confirmations and the cards are real, and run from one command.

21
00:02:20,797 --> 00:02:24,551
Relay Home. A changed pickup should not derail the whole evening.
